      "translation": "That Thou lovest all! 129",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਸਭ ਨੂੰ ਪਿਆਰ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੨੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सु सरबा अनुरागे ॥१२९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74729",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0056",
      "lineIndex": 56,
      "gurmukhi": "ਤ੍ਰਿਭੁਗਤ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "tirabhugat saroop hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art the Enjoyer Entity of three worlds!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ!) ਤੇਰਾ ਸਰੂਪ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਲੋਕਾ ਨੂੰ ਭੋਗਣ ਵਾਲਾ (ਆਨੰਦ-ਦਾਇਕ) ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "तृभुगत सरूप हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74730",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0057",
      "lineIndex": 57,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਛਿੱਜ ਹੈਂ ਅਛੂਤ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "achhi'j hai(n) achhoot hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art Unbreakable and untouched!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੇਰਾ ਰੂਪ ਵਿਨਾਸ਼ (ਛਿਜਣ) ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ ਅਤੇ ਪਵਿਤਰ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अछिज्ज हैं अछूत हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74731",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0058",
      "lineIndex": 58,
      "gurmukhi": "ਕਿ ਨਰਕੰ ਪ੍ਰਣਾਸ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "k naraka(n) pranaas hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art the Destroyer of hell!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਨਰਕ ਨੂੰ ਨਸ਼ਟ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "कि नरकं प्रणास हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74732",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0059",
      "lineIndex": 59,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪ੍ਰਿਥੀਉਲ ਪ੍ਰਵਾਸ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੩੦॥",
      "transliteration": "piratheeaul pravaas hai(n) ||130||",
      "translation": "That Thou Pervadest the Earth! 130",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਪ੍ਰਿਥਵੀ ਉਤੇ ਨਿਵਾਸ ਕਰਨ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੩੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "पृथीउल प्रवास हैं ॥१३०॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74733",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0060",
      "lineIndex": 60,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਿਰੁਕਤਿ ਪ੍ਰਭਾ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "nirukat prabhaa hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thy Glory is Inexpressible!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਹੇ ਪ੍ਰਭੂ!) ਨਾ ਵਰਣਨ ਕੀਤੇ ਜਾ ਸਕਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਤੇਰਾ ਤੇਜ ਹੈ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "निरुकति प्रभा हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74734",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0061",
      "lineIndex": 61,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਦੈਵੰ ਸਦਾ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "sadhaiva(n) sadhaa hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou art Eternal!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਸਦਾ ਵਰਤਮਾਨ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सदैवं सदा हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74735",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0062",
      "lineIndex": 62,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਿਭੁਗਤਿ ਸਰੂਪ ਹੈਂ ॥",
      "transliteration": "bibhugat saroop hai(n) ||",
      "translation": "That Thou abidest in innumerable diverse guises!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਤੂੰ ਹੀ ਸਾਰੀ ਭੋਗਣਯੋਗ ਸਾਮਗ੍ਰੀ ਹੈਂ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 7,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बिभुगति सरूप हैं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74736",
      "sourceShabadId": "7414",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0007_line_0063",
      "lineIndex": 63,
      "gurmukhi": "ਪ੍ਰਜੁਗਤਿ ਅਨੂਪ ਹੈਂ ॥੧੩੧॥",
